# harness/tbx/smoke.events -- the LOCKED event script of the SMOKETPS
# three-way differential (bead initech-tdnl.22; test-flairstub-smoke).
# One event per line: what message modifiers when h v (spec/toolbox_gate.h
# Sec 6, the flat FlairEvent). The window (120,90)-(400,230) has its content
# at (121,109) in the host model (harness/tbx/tbxmodel.c).
#   updateEvt for window 1         -> the paint (origin 109/121, counts 0)
6 1 0 10 0 0
#   mouseDown at global (200,150)  -> local (79,41): a 3x3 black mark
1 0 0 20 200 150
#   keyDown 'a' (vkey 0x1E)        -> the key in the cells at (200,64)
3 0x1E61 0 30 0 0
#   Edit > Copy  (130 << 16 | 1)   -> SCRAP_PUT "Smoke on the Scrap"
81 0x00820001 0 40 0 0
#   Edit > Paste (130 << 16 | 2)   -> SCRAP_GET, the 18 bytes drawn
81 0x00820002 0 50 0 0
#   File > About (129 << 16 | 3)   -> ALERT (two lines, OK + Cancel)
81 0x00810003 0 60 0 0
#   the alert's answer: default    -> 1 drawn at row 112
144 1 0 70 0 0
#   updateEvt again                -> counts now 1 click, 1 key = 101
6 1 0 80 0 0
#   the close box (goAway ASK)     -> EXIT 0
32 1 0 90 0 0
#   a mouseDown after EXIT         -> never delivered (DEC-AC3-3)
1 0 0 100 210 160
